From 281611f0b8014770630eea9f241a159320a61ec2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Olivier Cochard <olivier@FreeBSD.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:49:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] snd_acp: Add a driver for AMD ACP 7.x digital microphones

The built-in microphones of Strix Halo laptops are wired to the ACP's
PDM interface, not to the HDA codec, so FreeBSD had no way to record
from them.  Capture only: no DSP, I2S or SoundWire.  The PCI ID is
exported so that devmatch(8) loads the module on machines with an
ACP 7.x.
